{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6356","title":"Xiaomi SkyNomad Family Unveiled: Four Intelligent, Reconfigurable, Large-Space SUVs Starting from RMB 209,900","desc":"The lineup stretches from the accessible, five-seat Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Pro to the flagship Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio, whose electric lifting cabin roof and 30-second bed-mode turn the SUV into a true mobile living space.","view_cnt":"17184","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1788787167","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/195_operatorx_operatorx_opx/07/09/2026/20bd78d0d473559656f84da7a63bcfd0.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, September 7th, 2026 —\u003c/strong\u003e Xiaomi Auto officially launched Xiaomi SkyNomad Series at Xiaomi Fall Flagship Launch Event, introducing the all-new Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 and Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 models. As an Intelligent, Reconfigurable, Large-space SUV family built on the Xiaomi Kunlun Platform, Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Pro and Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max target the five-seat extended-range SUV segment, Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max positions itself as a seven-seat flagship for both business and family use, and Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio takes things further, transforming the vehicle into a mobile living space with a two-level loft layout, a second row that converts to a bed in 30 seconds, floor heating, and an electric lifting cabin roof. All four share the Xiaomi Kunlun Technical Architecture, each answering a different vision of what a car should be.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe launch covers four models:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 Pro\u003c/strong\u003e: Five-seat extended-range SUV, the gateway to an Intelligent, Reconfigurable, Large-space SUV\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max\u003c/strong\u003e: Five-seat all-wheel-drive extended-range SUV, the benchmark for an Intelligent, Reconfigurable, Large-space SUV\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max\u003c/strong\u003e: Seven-seat flagship extended-range SUV, the all-around flagship for business and family\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio\u003c/strong\u003e: A mobile personal space, featuring a factory-integrated electric lifting cabin roof, designed for professionals as a mobile studio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ctable style=\"text-align: center; width: 749px;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol style=\"width: 616px;\"\u003e\u003ccol style=\"width: 133px;\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"616,133\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad Series Official Pricing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"616\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 Pro ｜ Five-Seat Extended-Range SUV\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eRMB 209,900\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"616\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max ｜ Five-Seat AWD Extended-Range SUV\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eRMB 239,900\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"616\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max ｜ Seven-Seat Flagship Extended-Range SUV\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eRMB 269,900\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"616\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio ｜ Mobile Personal Space\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eRMB 299,900\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70: A New Answer for Five-Seat Extended-Range SUVs\u003c/h1\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBody Surfaces and Stance, Designed for Space\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Auto has always adhered to the philosophy of \"design that stands the test of time.\" Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 shares the same design language and style as Xiaomi SkyNomad N90, with a commanding, composed presence that continues the classic luxury SUV proportions of a short front overhang and long rear overhang.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRefined and composed: body proportions and stance are a projection of interior space\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 measures 4,960mm in length, 1,998mm in width, and has a wheelbase of 2,950mm. The body surfacing is clean and restrained, with all edges rounded off for a boxy silhouette that creates a cavernous interior space. The side profile looks younger and more athletic, with a forward-leaning D-pillar and subtle roofline slope creating a sense of power and momentum.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/918_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/08/09/2026/8cd1c1fbdbb04c342381a7b512b285b2.png\" alt=\"A blue SUV is parked on a smooth surface, with a soft sky and distant mountains in the background. The car's design is modern, and the front features the brand name \u0026quot;SKYMONAD N70.\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe signature dragonfly headlights feature a \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-beam range of up to 624 meters\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003elow-beam coverage angle of 180°\u003c/strong\u003e, for clear visibility at night and on narrow roads. The halo-shaped taillights with their inverted U-shaped design are wide and stable, offering rich light layering and strong recognizability.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/611_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/751e6aa73c224a7446f9662627cdb7b0.jpg\" alt=\"A rear view of a blue SUV, with the markings \u0026quot;SKYNOMAD\u0026quot; and \u0026quot;N70 Max\u0026quot; on the body, unique tail light design, and a white rear bumper at the bottom. The background is a gradient color, highlighting the vehicle's appearance.\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/532_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/50b1ed7143d59c44b57e7b61aa4cc976.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSix Colors: Effortlessly Balancing Fashion and Classic\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 is available in \u003cstrong\u003eValley Blue, Mountain Green, Pearl White, Volcanic Gray, Obsidian Black, and Light Khaki\u003c/strong\u003e, a palette that blends fashion, luxury, and timeless appeal.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eValley Blue\u003c/strong\u003e: Inspired by the mountain waters and skies deep within a valley. Under sunlight, the layers of color are finely textured; on overcast days, it takes on the deep blue tone of a mountain stream, understated and elegant.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMountain Green\u003c/strong\u003e: The color of distant mountains, where blue and green merge in quiet subtlety. As light shifts, it evokes the misty verdant hues of mountain ridges, refined and introspective.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePearl White\u003c/strong\u003e: Derived from the luster of natural seawater pearls. Not a plain white, its sheen shifts with the angle, lively, delicate, and full of vitality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVolcanic Gray\u003c/strong\u003e: The natural color of cooled lava flows. A high-purity gray layered with nano-scale mineral particles that reveals a fine, multi-dimensional metallic texture in changing light.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eObsidian Black\u003c/strong\u003e: The depth of black fused with a gemstone-like luster. Dignified, commanding, and full of mystery and power.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLight Khaki\u003c/strong\u003e: Inspired by the natural tones of earth, sand, and morning mist. More restrained than beige, cooler than khaki, a neutral gray with an inherent sense of refinement.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe interior is available in three colorways (\u003cstrong\u003eCream Beige, Mocha Brown, and Nightscape Black\u003c/strong\u003e), three distinct design moods to suit different aesthetic preferences.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Interior Starting with Experience: Refined Comfort Within Reach\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrawing from home furnishing design concepts, Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 features a \u003cstrong\u003e\"cabinet-style center console\"\u003c/strong\u003e, a \u003cstrong\u003e\"sliding center console\"\u003c/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eup to 33 storage compartments\u003c/strong\u003e. Paired with a 1,530mm full-width dashboard display and 6.14m² of glass area, the cabin feels open and transparent, creating a refined, home-like atmosphere. The \u003cstrong\u003e256-color digital light curtain ambient lighting\u003c/strong\u003e system uses diffuse reflection to create a theater-like lighting atmosphere.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/802_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/b6ad30fd0d2cb63a8327770699f365e8.jpg\" alt=\"The interior perspective showcases a modern interior design featuring a digital instrument panel and a large central control screen. The seats are made of light-colored leather, and the overall style is minimalist yet high-end.\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/882_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/c5665023afa9f3494435b55ab7f97371.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e95% of high-touch surfaces throughout the vehicle are \u003cstrong\u003esoft-wrapped\u003c/strong\u003e, and the \u003cstrong\u003eOEKO-TEX®-certified interior\u003c/strong\u003e is suitable for direct skin contact, including for infants under three, helping reduce concerns about allergens or harmful-substance migration. The cabin also comes standard with an energy-efficient \u003cstrong\u003eheat pump air conditioning\u003c/strong\u003e system, independent B-pillar air vents for the second row, so everyone can find their ideal temperature. The front seatbacks feature a 15-layer stacked construction that provides both comfort and support. Sitting down, you're enveloped as if in a plush lounge chair.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIntelligent, Reconfigurable, Large-space: Returning to the Source of Needs, Letting Space Adapt to People\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 is built on the \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Kunlun Platform\u003c/strong\u003e, featuring an Intelligent, Reconfigurable, Large-space design that achieves a layout rarely seen in mid-to-large extended-range SUVs: a completely flat floor with extra-long sliding rails. This eliminates the step-up design common in traditional mid-to-large SUVs for flexible, open space throughout. In the Xiaomi Kunlun Platform's design logic, space is no longer a byproduct of structural compromises. It is the starting point of product development, reserving space for those sitting inside.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/775_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/b61297f8830efbe07efde186d585d639.jpg\" alt=\"A showcase of an electric vehicle chassis, made of silver metal material, equipped with a tire and some mechanical components, with a black background and a display stand at the bottom.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlat Floor Running Through: Ultra-Large, Open Space; Storage and Camping Made Easy\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 comes standard with a flat floor. From the first and second rows to the trunk, the flat floor features only a \u003cstrong\u003e2.95°\u003c/strong\u003e incline, extending \u003cstrong\u003eup to 2.58 meters\u003c/strong\u003e with a flat area of 4.01m². Five extra-long sliding rails are fitted, with the longest reaching 1.56 meters, allowing the second-row seats to slide up to 600mm for flexible space configuration.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith the second-row seats in their standard position, the legroom measures \u003cstrong\u003e1,010mm\u003c/strong\u003e with 1,021mm of headroom, so passengers up to 1.9 m can stretch out comfortably. With the second-row seats pushed to their rearmost position, maximum legroom reaches \u003cstrong\u003e1,410mm\u003c/strong\u003e, 50% more than comparably sized vehicles, offering class-leading spaciousness. The trunk offers 1,203 liters of cargo space in its standard configuration, easily accommodating strollers, scooters, and daily essentials, or up to 10 suitcases. With the second-row seats folded flat, the cavernous 2,425-liter space can fit up to 38 twenty-inch suitcases. Beyond sheer volume, the trunk opening is wide and the sill is low, making it easy for the whole family to load and unload luggage. \u003cstrong\u003eThe rear doors open to nearly 90°\u003c/strong\u003e, with a \u003cstrong\u003esill height of just 385mm\u003c/strong\u003e from the ground, and \u003cstrong\u003eelectric door sills\u003c/strong\u003e that make getting in and out easier and safer for children and elderly passengers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Mobile Home: A Different Seating Position Means a Different Space\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBased on in-depth research into users' most frequent scenarios, Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 features a curated set of one-touch signature scenarios for nearly effortless convenience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFamily Tea Break\u003c/strong\u003e: Front seats rotate rearward for face-to-face meals or tea. The flat floor plus a sliding rail-mounted table transforms the space; after the meal, the table folds away and the second row becomes a rest area. With up to 1,410mm of second-row legroom, children can even do homework in the car, with the car-mounted table doubling as a study desk, all in a quiet, undisturbed cabin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/916_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/9648b8a8b04404d1b6935a82e6714f30.jpg\" alt=\"The interior of the car features beige leather seats and foldable tables, with a minimalist design on the walls and ceiling, including a sunroof. The overall style is modern and comfortable.\"\u003e*Rail-mounted table sold separately\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFamily Playground\u003c/strong\u003e: Front seats rotate and slide back, second-row seats slide rearward, creating an expansive family zone. Young families no longer need to juggle feeding, diaper changes, and playtime on the go.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/653_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/eceaf5b43377bac4515837644fd47be4.jpg\" alt=\"The luxury car interior features beige leather seats and a central armrest, which includes cup holders and a small table. The overall design is simple and modern. The interior space is spacious, with natural light coming in from the windows.\"\u003e*Cup holder-mounted table sold separately\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum Cargo\u003c/strong\u003e: The trunk's maximum depth is 1.9 meters with up to 2,425 liters of expandable space. Whether it's a weekend camping trip with tents, chairs, cookbooks, and outdoor gear, or a weekend shopping run with large appliances and furniture, everything fits in one trip.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/229_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/e3691409ee6f0d589703b96a28b71ea5.jpg\" alt=\"The interior of the car trunk has the backrest of the rear seat placed upright, with a flat black floor at the bottom and beige upholstery surrounding it, creating a spacious and bright environment.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFirst-Class Mode\u003c/strong\u003e: Second-row seats slide rearward for up to 1,410mm of legroom, instantly creating a \"first-class\" experience. Even large family dogs can stretch out comfortably on the spacious flat floor, ideal for pet owners.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/146_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/aaf19552e4b799f809aad8e5d54bb95d.jpg\" alt=\"The interior of the back seat of the car features light-colored leather seats with diamond patterns, accompanied by a central armrest and cup holders, all designed in a minimalist modern style.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Luxury Comfortable Cabin: Refrigerator, Screen, and Lounge Seating, Plus Premium Xiaomi Astral Sound System\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLounge Seating\u003c/strong\u003e: Front seats are comfortable yet supportive, with 15-layer stacked seatback construction. Standard features include 16-point massage, ventilation, and heating. Massage seats, zero-gravity seats, or rotating seats are available as options.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/358_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/9704112320bd2ec09f0d9a30907f35fe.png\" alt=\"A disassembled diagram of a car seat is displayed, with the complete seat on the left and the various components on the right, including the cushion, backrest, bracket, and external covering materials. The background features a gradient color, highlighting the design details of the seat.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnboard Refrigerator\u003c/strong\u003e: A 9-liter ultra-large capacity, standing up to 10 cans of 330 ml Coca-Cola. It uses an independent compressor for seamless switching between heating and cooling, and features Flyback technology so cold drinks can be conveniently stored in the car.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/432_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/9a30d58f973fd97d413dc95c72cb5775.png\" alt=\"There are ten cans of beverages in the drawer inside the car, the background is the car interior, and the floor is a dark-colored carpet.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRear Entertainment Screen\u003c/strong\u003e: A 21.4-inch screen with a viewing distance of up to 1.15 meters, offering a great view from nearly every seat.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Pro comes standard with a 14-speaker sound system including a 200mm ultra-large subwoofer and 2 headrest speakers. Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max features Xiaomi Auto's self-developed acoustic flagship, \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Astral Sound System\u003c/strong\u003e, with 25 speakers in a 7.1.4 acoustic architecture, 4,890 W peak power, and 7 titanium-dome tweeters for more transparent, detailed, and stable high frequencies. Leveraging Xiaomi SkyNomad's large space, the \u003cstrong\u003esound field layout has been redesigned\u003c/strong\u003e, incorporating \"direct-firing tweeters,\" \"presence midrange,\" and \"reflected bass.\" Front tweeters sit on the triangular windows and rear tweeters on the B-pillars, directing sound toward passengers and minimizing reflections. Midrange speakers are positioned at the upper front corners of the door panels, closer to the tweeters, for more present vocals. Bass uses three reflective surfaces (door panels, floor, and dashboard) for wider coverage with fuller low-frequency energy and powerful, impactful output.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eEase Range Anxiety: A Large Car That's Easy to Drive\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Kunlun HyperRange: Go the Distance with Confidence\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 is equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Kunlun Hyper Range System\u003c/strong\u003e, a large-battery extended-range architecture delivering ultra-long electric range and ultra-low depleted-battery fuel consumption.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 Pro features a \u003cstrong\u003e52 kWh lithium iron phosphate Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery\u003c/strong\u003e with a CLTC pure-electric range of \u003cstrong\u003e351km\u003c/strong\u003e and a CLTC combined range of up to \u003cstrong\u003e1,351km\u003c/strong\u003e. It uses a front-wheel-drive architecture with a 0-100km/h time of 7.9 seconds, charging once every five days for daily commutes, helping reduce range anxiety.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max features dual-motor all-wheel drive, accelerating from 0-100km/h in 5.5 seconds, and is equipped with a \u003cstrong\u003e76 kWh ternary lithium Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery\u003c/strong\u003e with a CLTC pure-electric range of \u003cstrong\u003e505km\u003c/strong\u003e and a CLTC combined range of 1,461km, one of the leading pure-electric ranges among extended-range vehicles, usable as a pure EV for daily city driving. Charging from 20% to 80% takes as fast as 18 minutes, with 310km of CLTC range replenished in up to 15 minutes. Public charger compatibility is excellent, with a 99% first-attempt success rate, helping ease range anxiety.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor long-distance travel, the range performance is reassuring. Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max achieves a fuel consumption as low as \u003cstrong\u003e6.1L/100km\u003c/strong\u003e in depleted-battery mode, while Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Pro's depleted-battery fuel consumption is just \u003cstrong\u003e5.7L/100km\u003c/strong\u003e, excellent for the segment. The range extender requires its first service after 3 years or 30,000km, and the entire lineup supports \u003cstrong\u003e92, 95, and 98 octane gasoline\u003c/strong\u003e for convenient, cost-effective travel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Large Car That's Easy to Drive: Agile, Confident, and Easy to Handle\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 inherits the driving DNA hardware foundation of Xiaomi SU7 and Xiaomi YU7. Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 features a \u003cstrong\u003efront double-wishbone independent suspension\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003erear integrated multi-link independent suspension\u003c/strong\u003e. Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max comes standard with 5-level adjustable air suspension paired with continuously variable damping, plus four hydraulic bushings front and rear, effectively filtering road vibration for a smooth, comfortable ride.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 has a turning radius of just \u003cstrong\u003e5.67 meters\u003c/strong\u003e, with steering precise enough to U-turn across three lanes in one go. The steering feel is adjustable in three modes, using an R-EPS rack-type electric power steering system that delivers authentic road feel and precise control, making this large car nimble and easy to handle. Braking is confident: 100-0km/h stopping distance is just \u003cstrong\u003e38.25 meters\u003c/strong\u003e, with performance remaining stable even after 10 consecutive stops. Whether it's city commuting or long-distance road trips, Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 gives you the confidence and peace of mind you need.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAdvanced Intelligent Ecosystem: AI Empowers Every Family, Every Scenario\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull-Vehicle Intelligence, One Step: AI-Powered Xiaomi Hyper XiaoAi AI Voice Assistant Understands Your Every Need in One Command\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 is equipped with the \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Super EEA\u003c/strong\u003e, achieving a \u003cstrong\u003efour-in-one domain control module\u003c/strong\u003e, making it smaller, lighter, more energy-efficient, and faster. It features the third-generation Snapdragon® 8 mobile platform on an advanced 4 nm process, instant app launches and smooth system operation. The entire lineup also comes standard with the NVIDIA Thor-U assisted driving chip, delivering 700 TOPS of computing power for faster response and stronger decision-making.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe entire vehicle is fitted with the \u003cstrong\u003eFlyback onboard low-voltage power supply system\u003c/strong\u003e. When the fridge or sentry mode is active with the vehicle off, energy consumption is reduced by 60% compared to non-Flyback power supplies, for more reliable power usage. The vehicle features eFuse intelligent power distribution: traditional fuses take over 10 ms to disconnect, while eFuse takes less than 100 μs, making full-vehicle power usage safer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe vehicle supports multi-screen connectivity, featuring an 8.88-inch instrument display, a 16.1-inch central control screen, and an optional 21.4-inch rear entertainment screen. The front passenger seatback can accommodate a tablet mount supporting four Xiaomi tablet models, enabling seamless content sharing across the entire family. \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Hyper XiaoAi AI Voice Assistant has been fully upgraded\u003c/strong\u003e, covering 95% of vehicle control functions and enabling intelligent space orchestration: one command switches between more than ten layout modes. It understands intent like \"I want to lie down and watch the stars,\" then coordinates the seats, lighting, air conditioning, and sound system to create a stargazing mode in one touch. It also brings enhanced Apple device compatibility, \u003cstrong\u003efully integrating into the Apple ecosystem\u003c/strong\u003e for a friendlier experience for Apple users.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe entire lineup comes standard with the NVIDIA Thor-U chip, LiDAR, and 4DmmWave radar, offering fully loaded assisted driving hardware. The entire lineup features Xiaomi Hyper Assisted Driving with the XLA architecture, continuously optimizing user experience, supporting voice-controlled driving, spatial understanding, and intelligent prediction. The entire lineup comes standard with 25 safety assistance features, including AEB (Autonomous Emergency Braking) with expanding obstacle recognition capabilities and AES (Autonomous Emergency Steering) supporting up to two consecutive evasive maneuvers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSafety Above All: Comprehensive Protection Across Every Dimension, Every Scenario\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSafety is the prerequisite. Safety is the foundation. Safety is everything. Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 features the \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Kunlun Total Safety\u003c/strong\u003e system, delivering comprehensive safety protection across every seat and scenario.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArmor-Cage Steel-Aluminum Hybrid Body Structure: Safety Strength That Exceeds Its Class\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70's body uses high-strength steel and aluminum alloy for up to \u003cstrong\u003e91.3%\u003c/strong\u003e of its construction, balancing overall strength with lightweight design. \u003cstrong\u003e14 locations\u003c/strong\u003e use \u003cstrong\u003e2,200MPa Xiaomi ultra-high strength steel\u003c/strong\u003e, leading the segment. The \u003cstrong\u003e2,200MPa \"embedded roll cage\"\u003c/strong\u003e features hot-gas-expanded tubes from A-pillar to C-pillar, fully prepared for rollover scenarios. It also features an \u003cstrong\u003eintegrated hot-formed door ring\u003c/strong\u003e, significantly enhancing body load-bearing capacity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/928_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/162b595fb1da817078afc8cdba5b3b55.jpg\" alt=\"A disassembled car body is displayed, with some structures presented in blue, red, and yellow against a black background. The airbags and other components inside the car body are clearly visible, showcasing the details of automotive design and safety features.\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/639_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/64f7a0378ff2726608899c54336673c8.jpg\" alt=\"A colorful car frame is displayed, painted in red, blue, yellow, and white, with a black background, and the words \u0026quot;SKYNOMAD\u0026quot; and \u0026quot;Xiaomi Travel\u0026quot; next to it.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N70 comes standard with 9 airbags: first-row far-side airbags with 4-point mounting, second-row side airbags and side curtain airbags. Nine collision sensors are fitted as standard, covering a wider range of collision scenarios. Safety development for all seating positions, exceeding C-NCAP and CIASI requirements. The door handles feature a \u003cstrong\u003etriple-redundant design\u003c/strong\u003e: even if a collision cuts all power, the central locking still releases and doors still open, with mechanical release handles inside and out.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Armor Scale Battery: The Industry's Leading Battery Safety and Quality Standards\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi has placed great emphasis on battery R\u0026amp;D capabilities since the inception of its automotive venture, continuously accumulating technical expertise and practical experience in battery safety. Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery features 18 layers of hardcore structural safety protection, designed to withstand a 500J bottom impact, exceeding relevant national standards. Up to 16 layers of thermal safety protection ensure that at 55°C with a fully charged single cell undergoing thermal runaway, it is designed to resist thermal propagation, fire, and explosion. Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Pro is equipped with a 52kWh lithium iron phosphate Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery, and Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max with a 76kWh ternary lithium Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery, both undergoing comprehensive, end-to-end quality control and a simulated 300,000km durability test.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/729_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/7082ff32ac1f3b0bdbf62c740c38f984.jpg\" alt=\"Show a model called \u0026quot;SKYNOMAD\u0026quot;, with a layered structure, featuring a transparent stand and storage boxes of different colors, set against a black background. The overall design is modern and minimalist.\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/736_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/88f27ebad3017b246ca2a23a84795f31.jpg\" alt=\"Show a shelf arranged with various batteries, primarily blue-cased batteries and some white batteries, with labels that say \u0026quot;High Safety Customized Battery Cells.\u0026quot; The overall environment is simple, with a black background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe entire lineup comes standard with a \u003cstrong\u003eLow-Speed Auxiliary Lighting\u003c/strong\u003e located below the side mirrors, with a single-side coverage area of 12.88m². In low-light conditions, it activates automatically when the surround-view camera is engaged or parking assistance is in use, making the driving and parking experience safer and more reassuring. The vehicle features up to \u003cstrong\u003e650mm of wading capability\u003c/strong\u003e, handling scenarios such as urban flooding, and also supports emergency floating escape.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max: The Next-Generation \"Land Business Class\"\u003c/h1\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eA Flagship Extended-Range SUV Born for Space\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max is positioned as a \u003cstrong\u003eseven-seat flagship extended-range SUV\u003c/strong\u003e, with dimensions on par with mainstream 9-series flagship SUVs: 5,285mm in length, 1,998mm in width, and a 3,080mm wheelbase. The body surfacing is clean and restrained, with body lines supporting a commanding, broad outline, delivering a powerful \"boxy\" silhouette and a cavernous interior space.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/259_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/08/09/2026/946c85f6a6024d7356a2d9f3abfc8133.png\" alt=\"A blue SUV is parked in a foggy environment, with mountains and dim light in the background, creating a mysterious and tranquil atmosphere.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max is available in seven exterior colors: Mountain Green, Valley Blue, Volcanic Gray, Light Khaki, Pearl White, Obsidian Black, and one N90 Max exclusive color, Maroon Red. Inspired by aged fine wine, Maroon Red features a low brightness and medium-high saturation, deep and composed in shadow, blooming with a rich, gem-like, translucent red luster under light, warm and refined with exceptional texture. Three interior design options are available (Cream Beige, Mocha Brown, and Nightscape Black), whether warm and refined or business-luxurious, there's a choice to suit preference.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/467_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/6bf44b5dff033eacfe5c335f22547948.png\" alt=\"A variety of SUVs are neatly arranged outdoors, with mountains and mist in the background, showcasing the diversity and beauty of modern automotive design. The body colors include white, gray, blue, green, red, and black.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThe Flexible Space for Business Flagship and Family Flagship\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBusiness Flagship: The Next-Generation \"Land Business Class\"\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor many business professionals, the place they spend the most hours is not the office, but on the road, meeting clients, running projects, traveling, and attending meetings. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max redefines the mobile business space.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt 5.28 meters, this large flagship SUV adopts a \u003cstrong\u003e2+2+3 seven-seat layout\u003c/strong\u003e, with a commanding exterior presence that carries an air of authority without being ostentatious. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max supports \u003cstrong\u003efour-seat zero-gravity seating:\u003c/strong\u003e both front and second rows offering zero-gravity mode. Front seats are available in two configurations: \u003cstrong\u003ezero-gravity seats\u003c/strong\u003e that unlock a \"mobile first-class cabin\" for an MPV-level space experience; or \u003cstrong\u003erotating seats\u003c/strong\u003e with a table that transforms the cabin into an interactive lounge for face-to-face meals with family, discussing projects, signing contracts, or even opening a laptop to instantly create a personal office.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/137_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/7e5c8c41dd795d223c677e36332dc335.png\" alt=\"A man is sitting in the back seat of a luxury car, smiling while on the phone, with warm brown tones in the surrounding interior. The environment outside the car window is blurred, creating a cozy atmosphere.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFamily Flagship: Setting Off with the Whole Family and a Car Full of Happiness\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor most Chinese families, buying a car is never just for oneself. It's for the children, the parents, and every departure the whole family takes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen the whole family travels in Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max, \u003cstrong\u003eseven people and seven twenty-inch suitcases fit comfortably\u003c/strong\u003e. Second-row legroom measures 950mm, so passengers up to 1.9 m can sit comfortably. The center aisle to the third row is 180mm wide, allowing access without moving seats. Third-row legroom reaches 890mm with 962mm of headroom, so three adults can sit together with ease. The nearly 90° door opening and electric side steps let elderly passengers board without bending or struggling, and children board more safely. In maximum cargo mode, the expandable trunk can carry two 700C road bikes with full cycling gear, with no wheel removal needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/229_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/f630bc9354d7ca1f40c04d133793b66c.png\" alt=\"A family is busy loading luggage next to a blue SUV, with a woman putting bags into the trunk while another man assists her. Two children are playing nearby, with modern buildings and a paved stone road in the background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe small transitions of daily life hold the most practical needs, such as waiting between school runs, delivering lunch to a child, or the gap before an after-school class. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max is designed for these real-life moments. Park the car and it becomes a mobile dining room for lunch delivery. After picking up one child, while waiting for another to finish class, the child can do homework, read, or rest inside the car. Waiting is no longer just waiting; it's an extension of life.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/155_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/91baf08cea63ae9ef7f9ff2784969158.png\" alt=\"A family is enjoying lunch inside a luxury car, the children are sharing food, two lunch boxes and drinks are placed on the table, and outside the car window is green grass and trees.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eConfident Road Trips: A Large Car That's Easy to Drive, Experience Beyond Its Class\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEquipped with \"Xiaomi Kunlun Hyper Range System\": Industry-Leading Combined Range, Go the Distance with Confidence\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max is equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Kunlun Hyper Range System\u003c/strong\u003e, featuring dual-motor all-wheel drive, a 0-100km/h time of 5.9 seconds, and a top speed of 190km/h. It is fitted with a 76kWh ternary lithium Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery, delivering a CLTC pure-electric range of 464km and a \u003cstrong\u003ecombined range of up to 1,705km\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eenabling a non-stop trip from Shanghai to Beijing, over 1,000 kilometers, without recharging\u003c/strong\u003e. Energy efficiency is industry-leading, WLTC depleted-battery fuel consumption as low as \u003cstrong\u003e6.26L/100km.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/97_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/7ffc6ee5a324187eb0ad4d1efcdbc73a.jpg\" alt=\"An image of a car engine is displayed, with the engine set against a black background. At the bottom, there is a white display stand that features relevant technical specifications and performance data.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe chassis configuration is luxurious, coming standard with air springs and continuously variable damping shock absorbers. It features a \u003cstrong\u003efront double-wishbone independent suspension and a rear integrated multi-link independent suspension\u003c/strong\u003e. It smooths out bumps, stays composed through lane changes, and delivers linear acceleration, light and precise steering, and controlled braking, so even a large car is easy to drive.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIntelligent Safety Flagship\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor the intelligent cabin, Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max features a 16.1-inch 3K central control screen, a 20-inch HUD, an 8.88-inch instrument display, a 21.4-inch rear entertainment screen, a rear mobile control screen, and an expandable pad on the front passenger seatback, supporting six-screen connectivity for seamless content flow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max also features a rear-facing solid-state LiDAR\u003c/strong\u003e, with a maximum ranging accuracy of 2 cm, enabling it to handle more complex parking scenarios and alleviating the difficulty of parking a large vehicle, making parking assistance safer and more capable. It features the \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Kunlun Total Safety\u003c/strong\u003e system, with an \u003cstrong\u003earmored cage-type hybrid body\u003c/strong\u003e providing all-round occupant protection, extensively using \u003cstrong\u003e2,200 MPa ultra-high-strength steel, up to 16 locations\u003c/strong\u003e using 2,200 MPa hot-stamped steel to enhance strength at critical points. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max also features a \u003cstrong\u003e2,200 MPa \"embedded roll cage\"\u003c/strong\u003e with an integrated hot-stamped door ring (13-in-1), covering the A, B, C, and D pillars and the first, second, and third rows for comprehensive occupant cell protection. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max comes standard with \u003cstrong\u003e12 airbags\u003c/strong\u003e, ensuring all-round protection for passengers in all three rows. Triple-redundant door handles, up to 750mm of wading capability, and 160km/h tire blowout stability control are among the emergency safety features that comprehensively strengthen protection.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/893_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/acb2225760e8aa2dc707dda58d9ec17e.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/409_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/76c1250d4a44839d28a3e549b3301972.png\" alt=\"A close-up of one side of the car door shows the internal structure of the door, reflecting the external environment. There is a black rearview mirror beside the window, and the door handle has a modern design. The background is a blue sky, and the overall tone is calm.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio: A Mobile Personal Space\u003c/h1\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eA World That Moves With You: Exploring the Boundaries of Space\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne SUV. A world that moves with you. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio is Xiaomi Auto's boldest exploration of that idea, built on Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Rare Factory-Integrated Electric Lifting Cabin Roof SUV\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio features a factory-integrated electric lifting cabin roof, a design currently very rare on domestic SUVs. The roof's height increase is controlled at 100mm, finished in body color to blend seamlessly with the vehicle. The drag coefficient achieves a remarkably low Cd of 0.245 for a large extended-range SUV.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/246_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/d9e5725156843f55326f815edacb7e6c.png\" alt=\"A blue SUV is parked on a vast lawn, with a backdrop of a cloudy sky and tall grass surrounding it.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen the roof is raised, \u003cstrong\u003ethe interior transforms into a two-level loft space\u003c/strong\u003e. The total raised roof height is reaching up to 2,294mm, so adults up to 1.8 meters tall can stand upright even at the lowest point in the rear. The second-level activity area measures 2,110mm × 985mm, with a \u003cstrong\u003emaximum bed board length of 1,946mm\u003c/strong\u003e. It uses an aluminum metal frame with aluminum honeycomb panel reinforcement, supporting up to 200 kg while maintaining lightweight construction. The lifting cabin roof features three sides with five mesh screens; the forward-facing screen can be fully opened, offering 1.7m² of expansive window area for a panoramic viewing experience on the upper level. The factory-integrated upper level also includes air conditioning vents, an 18 W charging port, and magnetic mounting points, paired with an original 30mm comfort mattress in the same beige design as the interior, warm and refined.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/47_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/806fb7f78661a699ea53d8ffaba7871f.png\" alt=\"The interior space is showcased with multiple windows, through which the blue sky can be seen. The walls and floor present a warm beige color, making the space simple and bright, suitable for placing beds and other furniture.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRedesigned Large Five-Seat: Your Mobile Studio with a Bed and a Seat\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio reimagines the interior space, rethinking the concept of the second row entirely, with a new design that is more like an Italian sofa. \u003cstrong\u003eThe second row can transform into a bed in one touch\u003c/strong\u003e, no disassembly, no mattress needed, \u003cstrong\u003ejust 30 seconds to get a remarkably flat large bed\u003c/strong\u003e: 1.87 meters long, 1.24 meters wide, with classic diamond quilting, plump surfaces, and a soft touch that's comfortable for adults to lie on. It comes standard with ventilation and heating, cooling in summer and warming in winter, and features electric headrests that automatically flip and stow, eliminating the hassle of manual removal.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/26_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/954793dc92d2bbcf27b4a240d09bbcdc.png\" alt=\"A person is sitting inside a car, holding a camera, preparing to photograph the scenery outside the window. Outside the car window is the ocean and grasslands, with sunlight pouring into the car, creating a warm atmosphere. Inside the car, there is a book and a coffee cup.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/174_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/b9ed30ab5aba858dea4c3ebccaa204ff.png\" alt=\"The interior space showcases the back seat of a car, with the seats folded down to create a flat resting area. The decor features beige leather, and through the windows, a view of the ocean can be seen in the background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe second-row seats use a 40/60 split design, with both left and right sides capable of independently transforming into a bed. Set the left side as an independent bed and install a rail-mounted table on the right to create a personal refined living room where you can not only sit and work, eat, or play games, but you can also lie down and rest at any time. Living room, bedroom, and workspace, all effortlessly achieved in one vehicle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/320_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/2576b4cf83ad7e6d7196573ae32502c8.png\" alt=\"A man is sitting on the sofa inside the car, focused on working on his laptop, with a coffee cup placed beside him. The interior of the car is simple and comfortable, with soft lighting.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio features \u003cstrong\u003efactory wood-grain aluminum-alloy floor\u003c/strong\u003e, covering an area of 1.7m². Using a \u003cstrong\u003emulti-layer composite structure with an aluminum alloy frame\u003c/strong\u003e, the surface has a wood-grain texture design with a tactile, real-grain feel that creates a home-like atmosphere inside the vehicle. The flooring is ultra-wear-resistant, so after 6,000+ abrasion cycles, daily stepping, shoe friction, drink spills, and hard-object scratches are less likely to leave marks, and it stays easy to maintain and resistant to dirt and corrosion. \u003cstrong\u003eThe floor comes standard with factory-integrated floor heating\u003c/strong\u003e, using aviation-grade sealing materials, offering three adjustable temperature settings up to 38°C. In the cold northern winters, the car has floor heating, heat pump air conditioning, a heated steering wheel, and heated seats throughout, plus a fridge that can also heat, making the interior truly as warm as home.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/980_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/477a13b20c3faf1e1b12352e5e1e82e4.png\" alt=\"It shows a cross-sectional view of a car, clearly displaying the internal layout, especially the design of the seats and floor. The background features reflections of light on the water, creating a sense of modernity and technology.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eOne Vehicle, A Home Wherever You Go\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio supports a \u003cstrong\u003e30-inch screen\u003c/strong\u003e cinematic projection system, with an optimized support arm structure for better screen flatness. Draw the blackout curtains during the day for a clear picture; at night, the viewing experience is gentle on the eyes. The vehicle offers an industry-rare car-mounted large-screen viewing distance. With the second row pushed to its rearmost position, the viewing distance reaches 1,096mm for a highly immersive experience. It also features a unique \u003cstrong\u003e\"privacy screen mode\"\u003c/strong\u003e: the screen lowers without projection, serving as a cabin partition for privacy and light blocking simultaneously.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio goes beyond a driving companion, offering a suite of luxury features for personal retreat: a \u003cstrong\u003efloating nightstand\u003c/strong\u003e with soft fabric wrapping and a refined surface touch, featuring 220 V and 15 V dual outlets for on-the-go device charging; a \u003cstrong\u003e20-liter total capacity built-in cabinet\u003c/strong\u003e with individual lighting in each compartment for organizing watches, phones, and glasses at arm's reach; and an \u003cstrong\u003e11.5-inch vanity mirror\u003c/strong\u003e with a 115° opening angle, stepless positioning, and a 4,000 K ring light, so you can wake up and do your makeup right in the car, instantly transforming it into a mobile makeup studio for content creators.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/902_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/59c65312ddda137df2142bbc751e0688.png\" alt=\"A red phone and glasses are placed on a soft surface, surrounded by lighting, with the background showing details of the car interior.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/646_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/d93c8f71362441843728a04724df2827.png\" alt=\"A delicate storage cabinet with several bottles of skincare products and a potted plant inside. There is lighting above the cabinet, and a small mirror next to it, with a sea view in the background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor camping enthusiasts, this is an ideal \"camping vehicle.\" A large bed inside plus the rooftop loft space, 30 seconds to set up a \"private loft.\" While others are still pitching tents, your \"mobile campsite\" is ready to go.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/945_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/c0d885fa1591952cd9a6b76f7fbbd61f.png\" alt=\"A group of people is sitting around a campfire on the beach, enjoying their camping time. Next to them is an SUV with its tailgate open, surrounded by the tranquility of the night and the beautiful sky.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor creative professionals, Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio is a purpose-built mobile studio. With 220V power, Wi-Fi, a sound system, and a fridge, plus a table, sofa, bed, wood-grain flooring, and floor heating for maximum home comfort, plus a ceiling high enough to actually stand under. Drive into the mountains or park by the sea, coffee in hand, nature all around, and rediscover your creative source in the wild.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/158_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/4eeb0e10a8bc6fa30be85db92b0541cb.png\" alt=\"A man is sitting inside a car, using a laptop, with a small table nearby. Outside the car window, a blue sky and a sea view can be seen, and the interior of the car is decorated in a modern style with light-colored leather seats.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFlagship Performance, Standard Across the Lineup\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio shares the same luxury specifications and top-tier hardware as Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max: dual-motor all-wheel drive with a 0-100km/h time of 5.9 seconds; a 76kWh ternary lithium Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery with a CLTC pure-electric range of 462km and a CLTC combined range of 1,688km. Performance, range, driving dynamics, intelligence, and safety, all at flagship level across every dimension.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom the intelligently configurable spacious interior of Xiaomi SkyNomad N70, to Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max’s all-round versatility for both business and family use, and Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio’s bold exploration of the concept “the car as a lifestyle,” Xiaomi SkyNomad addresses all the key questions around space, range, safety, and intelligence in a single vehicle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA combined range of 1,705km (Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max) helps reduce range anxiety on long-distance journeys. The Xiaomi Kunlun Total Safety system helps raise the bar for vehicle safety, while Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max Studio’s electric lifting cabin roof and second-row seats that transform into a bed in just 30 seconds give the vehicle, for the first time, a genuine ability to “live” in.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad's goal is not to add another screen or feature to an existing category, but to turn the car into a mobile space that is truly your own.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e*Xiaomi SkyNomad Series is announced in 2026 and currently only available in the Chinese Mainland. \u003cbr\u003e**Data in this press release was retrieved from Xiaomi Auto Lab and/or partners, and may vary depending on models/configurations.\u003cbr\u003e***Some configurations are optional.\u003cbr\u003e****Xiaomi CarIoT accessories need to be purchased separately.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad Series product images available \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgDqBWgOMiPZRqQPAkEaLKKiATdiMwLJfMn_JSfXdXDDc0g?e=JP8Ij6\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In June 2026, the MAU reached 766.5 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of June 30, 2026, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,160.8 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 800,000 units by September 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2026, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the eighth year in a row, ranking 232nd.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"2195","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1788788498"},"common":null}